    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world is ending</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have entered the Forest of Souls looking for the monstrous beast spreading destruction into the world, withering it away. But defeating him will be no easy feat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mysterious powers found within the forest, work together with its denizens to unleash incredible abilities, and delve deep through its many branches to save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/090dc59b8c7445327c17b680a6a51cb6.poster.avif?t=1754748978\" width=600 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/090dc59b8c7445327c17b680a6a51cb6.webm?t=1754748978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/090dc59b8c7445327c17b680a6a51cb6.mp4?t=1754748978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Battles:</strong> The forest is filled with enemies that will try to stop you, defeat them in intense, turn-based combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern Roguelike:</strong> All the depth of a traditional roguelike, with a modern and beautiful interface that makes it very easy to play with a mouse or controller, but deep and hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest Dungeon:</strong> Explore the procedurally-generated forest and its many areas, from snowy valleys to lush jungles and barren deserts, each with its own challenges and enemies to face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rare Loot: </strong>There's always a reward for being a hero, the forest is filled with rare, powerful and unique items and abilities for you to use!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/84fb76497d44a1f033d908e05d44ff1b.poster.avif?t=1754748978\" width=600 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/84fb76497d44a1f033d908e05d44ff1b.webm?t=1754748978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/84fb76497d44a1f033d908e05d44ff1b.mp4?t=1754748978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Build Possiblities:</strong> Play as anything you want, from a minotaur berserker jumping straight into the fray, to a book wielding spellcasting elf ready to fling spells at their enemies, or a sneaky goblin hidding from their enemies and killing from the shadows, or a druid fighting with animal companions. Use any combination of classes, abilities and equipment, it's up to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how to play the game, you can stash away your precious loot after delving into a zone of the forest, or you can choose a more challenging roguelike mode where every run starts from zero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the many denizens of the forest to get their help and learn more about them, or what they might be hidding.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world is ending</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have entered the Forest of Souls looking for the monstrous beast spreading destruction into the world, withering it away. But defeating him will be no easy feat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mysterious powers found within the forest, work together with its denizens to unleash incredible abilities, and delve deep through its many branches to save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/090dc59b8c7445327c17b680a6a51cb6.poster.avif?t=1754748978\" width=600 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/090dc59b8c7445327c17b680a6a51cb6.webm?t=1754748978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/090dc59b8c7445327c17b680a6a51cb6.mp4?t=1754748978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Battles:</strong> The forest is filled with enemies that will try to stop you, defeat them in intense, turn-based combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern Roguelike:</strong> All the depth of a traditional roguelike, with a modern and beautiful interface that makes it very easy to play with a mouse or controller, but deep and hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest Dungeon:</strong> Explore the procedurally-generated forest and its many areas, from snowy valleys to lush jungles and barren deserts, each with its own challenges and enemies to face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rare Loot: </strong>There's always a reward for being a hero, the forest is filled with rare, powerful and unique items and abilities for you to use!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/84fb76497d44a1f033d908e05d44ff1b.poster.avif?t=1754748978\" width=600 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/84fb76497d44a1f033d908e05d44ff1b.webm?t=1754748978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/84fb76497d44a1f033d908e05d44ff1b.mp4?t=1754748978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Build Possiblities:</strong> Play as anything you want, from a minotaur berserker jumping straight into the fray, to a book wielding spellcasting elf ready to fling spells at their enemies, or a sneaky goblin hidding from their enemies and killing from the shadows, or a druid fighting with animal companions. Use any combination of classes, abilities and equipment, it's up to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how to play the game, you can stash away your precious loot after delving into a zone of the forest, or you can choose a more challenging roguelike mode where every run starts from zero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the many denizens of the forest to get their help and learn more about them, or what they might be hidding.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Explore the Forest of Souls as you defeat enemies in tactical, turn-based battles. Choose from a great variety of classes, races, abilities, and equipment to deeply customize your character in this highly replayable traditional roguelike, as you delve deeper to find out the truth about the forest.",
